    "summaryAr": "About Huzzle At Huzzle, we connect high-performing professionals with global companies across the UK, US, Canada, Europe, and Australia. Our clients include startups, digital agencies, and tech platforms in industries like SaaS, MarTech, FinTech, and EdTech. We match top sales talent to full-time remote roles where they’re hired directly into client teams and provided ongoing support by Huzzle. Role Type: Full-time E",
    "descriptionAr": "About Huzzle At Huzzle, we connect high-performing professionals with global companies across the UK, US, Canada, Europe, and Australia. Our clients include startups, digital agencies, and tech platforms in industries like SaaS, MarTech, FinTech, and EdTech. We match top sales talent to full-time remote roles where they’re hired directly into client teams and provided ongoing support by Huzzle. Role Type: Full-time Engagement: Independent Contractor About the Company Our client operates in the real estate and home improvement industry, specialising in bathroom remodelling. They help homeowners transform their bathrooms through tailored renovation solutions. They are looking for an experienced Dutch-speaking High-Ticket Sales Closer to join their sales team and convert qualified prospects into customers. Working directly with prospective customers through video sales calls, you'll be responsible for building rapport, understanding customer needs, handling objections, and closing high-value deals. This is an opportunity for a confident sales professional who knows how to create trust, communicate value, and consistently deliver results in a performance-driven environment. Key Responsibilities Conduct approximately 4–5 video sales calls per day with qualified prospects who have booked and attended their appointments Handle a target of approximately 45 qualified showed sales calls per month Convert qualified prospects into customers, targeting an average of 1–2 direct sales per day Build strong relationships with prospective customers through excellent communication, active listening, and rapport-building techniques Use mirroring techniques and an adaptable tone of voice to establish trust and connect with different customer personalities Understand customer requirements, present suitable solutions, and communicate the value of bathroom remodelling services Handle objections confidently and guide prospects through the decision-making process Apply culturally sensitive communication and closing techniques when engaging with Dutch-speaking customers Maintain accurate sales activity and follow-ups using the company's systems Work towards revenue generation targets, with a reference target of 400K Requirements Fluent in both Dutch and English (essential) Proven experience in sales, particularly cold calling and direct sales Demonstrable high-ticket sales and closing experience Strong objection-handling and negotiation skills Excellent verbal communication skills and a confident, engaging tone of voice Strong rapport-building, active listening, and mirroring skills Ability to adapt communication and closing techniques to different customer personalities and cultural backgrounds Comfortable conducting video sales calls and working towards daily sales and revenue targets Reliable, organised, and able to communicate availability consistently Familiarity with GoHighLevel, Slack, and Google Meet Nice to Have Previous experience in real estate or property-related sales Experience in construction, home improvement, or bathroom remodelling Experience selling high-value renovation or home improvement services Benefits 💻 Fully Remote: Work from anywhere with international teams 🚀 Career Growth: Join companies in SaaS, MarTech, and B2B services 🤝 Peer Community: Connect with high-performing sales professionals in our network 🧭 Ongoing Support: Receive guidance from Huzzle before and after placement 💰 Tailored Compensation: Salaries vary by client and candidate preference — we’ll match you with options that fit your goals Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow",
